 "remarks": "WELCOME to this spacious 2 bedroom townhouse style condo, conveniently located near both the Merritt Parkway and I-95, perfect for commuters. The open concept main level features a large living room with a cozy fireplace, abundant natural light from the oversized windows. Sliding glass doors off the dining/kitchen area lead to a private balcony, creating a perfect space to relax. Both bedrooms are generously sized and offer excellent closet space. Laundry and a half bath are located on the main floor. There is basement space for storage. Off street parking.",
